22. POINT PLAY ECOSYSTEM & VOUCHER DEPOSIT TERMS (INBOUND PAYMENTS)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
RudraX Technologies Studio provides an in-app Point Play Ecosystem allowing 
users to voluntarily load balance into their profile node (`/users/{uid}`) 
using accepted digital payment vouchers, specifically Amazon Gift Card vouchers.

  [A] VOLUNTARY TRANSACTION: All voucher submissions and balance top-ups are 
      executed entirely at the sole discretion and voluntary choice of the user. 
      RudraX Technologies Studio does not force, demand, or coerce any user to 
      purchase vouchers or fund their digital balance.

  [B] MINIMUM TRANSACTION THRESHOLD: The gateway enforces a strict minimum 
      deposit threshold of ₹100 per voucher submission. Submissions below 
      this limit will be rejected automatically.

  [C] 1:1 CONVERSION RATIO: Validated vouchers are credited to the user's 
      internal balance on a strict 1:1 ratio (e.g., a valid ₹3,000 voucher 
      grants exactly 3,000 ecosystem points). Points carry no fiat value 
      outside the platform.

  [D] ANTI-SPAM & SUBMISSION CONTROLS: To prevent automated flooding, fraud, 
      or duplicate requests, the platform implements a 24-hour transmission 
      window lock per user. All submissions pass through a restricted inbound 
      queue (`/admin/amazonPayments`) for executive verification.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
23. NO REFUND, NO RETURN & ABSOLUTE NO CANCELLATION POLICY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ALL DEPOSITS, VOUCHER SUBMISSIONS, AND POINT REDEMPTIONS COMPLETED WITHIN THE 
RUDRAX TECHNOLOGIES STUDIO ECOSYSTEM ARE FINAL, PERMANENT, AND NON-REFUNDABLE.

  [A] ZERO REFUNDS: Under no circumstances shall RudraX Technologies Studio 
      issue cash refunds, bank transfers, payment reversals, or chargebacks 
      for any submitted vouchers or purchased points.

  [B] WAIVER OF CLAIM: By submitting a voucher or making a payment, the user 
      explicitly agrees, confirms, and guarantees that they relinquish all 
      rights to initiate legal claims, payment disputes, or bank chargebacks 
      claiming unauthorized charges or non-receipt of cash return.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
24. OUTBOUND REDEMPTIONS & FINTECH SDK TOKEN FORGING
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Users may consume their accrued point balance to unlock digital services, 
subscriptions, or features across connected partner applications via the 
RudraX Bank Point interface and SDK Bridge infrastructure.

  [A] CRYPTOGRAPHIC TOKEN FORGING: Outbound requests debit the point balance 
      and generate a one-time, cryptographically salted token string 
      (e.g., 300V3YHC).

  [B] ATOMIC CONSUMPTION & ANTI-DOUBLE SPEND: External systems consuming the 
      SDK bridge (`/sdkBridgeCodes/{token}`) atomically mark tokens as 
      consumed (`consumedStatus: true`). Any attempt to reuse, duplicate, or 
      spoof token strings is strictly prohibited and flagged as fraud.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
25. FRAUD MITIGATION, ROLLBACK PROTOCOL & PENALTIES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
RudraX Technologies Studio enforces strict automated and executive anti-fraud 
monitoring over all point distributions and token generations.

  [A] FRAUDULENT VOUCHER REVERSAL: If a submitted voucher is invalidated, 
      reclaimed, chargebacked, or determined to be fraudulent post-approval, 
      RudraX Technologies Studio reserves the absolute right to execute an 
      immediate point rollback, deducting the equivalent amount from the account.

  [B] NEGATIVE BALANCE FLAGS: Point rollbacks may result in negative wallet 
      balances. Accounts with negative balances will be permanently locked 
      and flagged as security violations until reviewed.

  [C] LEGAL PROSECUTION FOR FRAUD: Users attempting to submit stolen, used, 
      or fake vouchers will suffer immediate permanent termination and will 
      be reported to law enforcement authorities.

